<title>USA: BioSafe receives Vermont operations permit.</title>
<headline>BioSafe receives Vermont operations permit.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>BioSafe International Inc said Wednesday it received the necessary permit from the State of Vermont to begin operations at the company's landfill in Moretown, Vt., and to accept an average of 350 tons of waste per day there.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
